<title>USA: Dialogic licenses Voxware product.</title>
<headline>Dialogic licenses Voxware product.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dialogic Corp said Tuesday it had agreed to license Voxware Inc's voice compression technology, MetaVoice.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Dialogic, which makes computer telephony products, will use MetaVoice to reproduce high quality speech with low communications bandwidth and processing power.</p>
<p>Dialogic said it plans to integrate Voxware's voice technology on its DM3 Internet telephony platform by the end of the year, the company said.</p>
</text>
